## Rationalist

insight-ration-1-name = Sense Anomaly
insight-ration-1-desc = Gain the ability to sense the location of the nearest anomaly.

insight-ration-2-name = Artifexium Burst
insight-ration-2-desc = Gain the ability to unleash a burst of artifexium, randomly triggering a primed node on all nearby artifacts.

insight-ration-3-name = Anomaly Generator
insight-ration-3-desc = Once per day, you can generate an anomaly of your choosing.

insight-ration-4-name = Upgrade Overclocker
insight-ration-4-desc = Once per day you can apply one upgrade past the limit on an item or machine.


## Priest

insight-priest-1-name = Powerful Prayer
insight-priest-1-desc = Gain the ability to pray with holy books. Your prayers are more visible to the Gods.

insight-priest-2-name = Miracle Worker
insight-priest-2-desc = You can zap someone back from the grasp of death with a healing touch.

insight-priest-3-name = Godly Chanter
insight-priest-3-desc = Your prayers grant a blessing to everyone nearby. The blessing will have a random collection of positive effects.

insight-priest-4-name = Personal Sanctuary
insight-priest-4-desc = At any altar can open a portal to a pocket dimension that belongs to you. The portal will remain open as long as anyone remains inside.

## Magician

insight-magic-1-name = Void Visionary
insight-magic-1-desc = Once per day you can peek into the Void and get a random rumor.

insight-magic-2-name = Basic Summoner
insight-magic-2-desc = Summon some other-worldly tentacles to grab and stun people!

insight-magic-3-name = Strange Alchemist
insight-magic-3-desc = Once per day, you can transmute a stack of steel into a more valuable material.

insight-magic-4-name = Advanced Summoner
insight-magic-4-desc = Once per day, you can create a pair of linked portals which last for four hours.